			Lacon.
		), <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀαδεῖν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχλεῖν, ἀπορεῖν,</span>
		<u>Et.Gud.</u>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>, Phot.<i><span class="en">
			p.3R.
		</span></i> (prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-ϝαδεῖν,</span> cf.
